Subject: USB controller: accept the rumble output report

When Story Mode starts, the game sends the controller its rumble report (HID SET_REPORT). The pad
stalled it, XAPI took the device for broken and XPP followed a garbage pointer (005C42AC). The
report is accepted; rumble is not passed to the host pad yet.

---
diff --git a/src/usb/usb_gamepad.c b/src/usb/usb_gamepad.c
--- a/src/usb/usb_gamepad.c
+++ b/src/usb/usb_gamepad.c
@@ -210,6 +210,10 @@
         }
         return -1;
     }
+
+    /* HID SET_REPORT (rumble output report): accepted */
+    if ((setup->bmRequestType & 0x60u) == 0x20u && setup->bRequest == 0x09u && !is_in)
+        return 0;
 
     /* Class requests: not ours to guess at. */
     return -1;
